          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Range of A}&=(14.2-12.4)\\,\\text{s}\\\\\\text{Range of A}&=1.8\\,\\text{s}\\\\\\text{Range of B}&=(15.2-11.8)\\,\\text{s}\\\\\\text{Range of B}&=3.4\\,\\text{s}\\end{align*}$$\n\nSprinter A is more consistent because its times have the smaller range.",
